A folder with no CONTRACT line has no `.mdc` yet. Do not invent one in passing. Drafts never modify `.mdc` files: write under `standards/contract/proposals/`. Do not add a per-feature `philosophy.md`. The definition of a contract is `standards/contract/philosophy.md`. Mark `CONTRACT` only when that definition is met in code. When you mark it, add that entity or functionality's names to the workspace rule description (`DL_projects/.cursor/rules/dl_toolbox_structure.mdc`).
